	(text "POWER SUPPLY: 5 V → 3.3 V\n\n- J1: Regulated 5 V input; pin 1 = +5 V, pin 2 = GND.\n- D1: Reverse-polarity protection.\n- U1: TLV75533PDBV, 3.3 V / 500 mA LDO.\n  Allowable continuous current depends on PCB thermal design.\n- EN: Connected to VIN for always-on operation.\n- C1/C2: Input bulk and decoupling capacitors.\n- C3/C4: Output decoupling and bulk capacitors.\n  Place C2/C3 close to U1.\n- D2: Optional reverse-current bypass diode.\n  Anode = VOUT; cathode = VIN.\n  Protects the LDO when VOUT exceeds VIN; does not block backfeed.\n- R1/D3: 3.3 V power indicator.\n- TP1: GND test point.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.708 132.842 0)
